{"code": 1, "data": {"content": "<p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\">5月14日，蓝箭航天朱雀二号改进型遥五运载火箭（ZQ-2E Y5）在东风商业航天创新试验区成功发射。这枚火箭上，清晰印着&ldquo;京东快递&rdquo;的标志，跟着火箭一起飞向太空。<span data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><br /></span></p>\n<section><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1778818525632.png\" alt=\"图片\" width=\"1080\" height=\"684\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/obuknibTL19ZnHLsOoALcsEb0u47pyp91xvHjjwP6RnTvibS4eOu41ZtlkYX2qnXe8MHhQFDialjKQBMELvcydbUIgqr8mySfAYtyjHqYibu8Gg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg#imgIndex=0\" data-ratio=\"0.6333333333333333\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" data-imgfileid=\"503590721\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-original-style=\"null\" data-index=\"3\" data-report-img-idx=\"0\" data-fail=\"0\" /></section>\n<p>这是商业航天领域首次引入面向火箭运输团队的完整物流保障方案，依托超级供应链和创新科技能力，不仅是传统的&ldquo;运送大件货物&rdquo;，更是&ldquo;保障一支执行任务的工程队伍&rdquo;。</p>\n<p><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1778818537267.png\" alt=\"图片\" width=\"1080\" height=\"720\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/obuknibTL19aiafpS5KMmt5TBTHmR4eKsvTsEJ12x13hjmNR4ogZxxXm77c03ibuoKSb7Y1zf6MdJIFOFpZub2VTlxIoPxMnY5c11wSXm1aKgY/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg#imgIndex=1\" data-ratio=\"0.6666666666666666\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" data-imgfileid=\"503590702\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-original-style=\"null\" data-index=\"4\" data-report-img-idx=\"1\" data-fail=\"0\" /></p>\n<p>从浙江到东风商业航天创新试验区，跨越约3500公里的转运途中，京东物流与火箭运输团队协同作业，围绕人员行程衔接、关键节点配合和复杂路段护送提供支持，让工程人员可以专注于火箭本身，而不用分心于跨区域转运的组织与协调。&nbsp;</p>\n<section><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1778818549164.png\" alt=\"图片\" width=\"1080\" height=\"585\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/obuknibTL19aZorRKFmLEReBlJUVev5aSzBqWBzttsTKy0cZu35PVojVRYjIKM0XNsWDf7IymIWiaib7OWpc8IfSf6tlbdYj46OSEzPce8mxibY/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg#imgIndex=2\" data-ratio=\"0.5416666666666666\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" data-imgfileid=\"503590685\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-original-style=\"width: 770px;height: 416px;\" data-index=\"5\" data-report-img-idx=\"2\" data-fail=\"0\" /></section>\n<p>在发射基地，京东物流第六代&ldquo;独狼&rdquo;无人车亮相，它在戈壁滩的极寒、大风环境里，靠自动驾驶为火箭转运领航带路，并在发射基地里试点使用。工作人员日常只需操作手机，无人车便凭借L4级自动行驶，完成从站点到宿舍、办公室的&ldquo;最后几百米&rdquo;运送。<span data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><br /></span></p>\n<section><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1778818563448.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" width=\"1080\" height=\"767\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/obuknibTL19a4ia5H0v2kwpicq48VNXtwdMJYjytthxiaiayS6tCrMxq1WNS6nzicG8RL6LpM7nVREU9UGpYCttJPicsWIChicGkHWbwEQppKIv2JQ4/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg#imgIndex=3\" data-ratio=\"0.7101851851851851\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"1080\" data-imgfileid=\"503590686\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-original-style=\"width: 2420px;height: 1719px;\" data-index=\"6\" data-report-img-idx=\"3\" data-fail=\"0\" /></section>\n<p>早在2015年，京东物流就在东风航天城设立了快递站点，解决了科研人员收寄快递难的问题，还针对他们工作时间不固定、工作地点分散等困难提供贴心的定制服务，成为基地的&ldquo;后勤小管家&rdquo;。</p>\n<p><span class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" title=\"\" data-remoteid=\"\" data-asynid=\"\" data-src=\"\" data-ratio=\"\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"\" aria-label=\"\" aria-braillelabel=\"\" aria-description=\"\" data-width=\"\" data-height=\"\" data-croporisrc=\"\" data-cropx1=\"\" data-cropx2=\"\" data-cropy1=\"\" data-cropy2=\"\" data-cropselx1=\"\" data-cropselx2=\"\" data-cropsely1=\"\" data-cropsely2=\"\" data-backw=\"\" data-backh=\"\" data-copyright=\"\" data-oversubscription-url=\"\" data-before-oversubscription-url=\"\" data-galleryid=\"\" data-gallerysupplier=\"\" data-cardimg=\"\" data-fileid=\"\" data-imgfileid=\"503590706\" data-positionback=\"\" data-imgqrcoded=\"\" data-imgid=\"\" data-upload=\"\" data-fromlib=\"\" data-aiimageid=\"\" data-aiimagesource=\"\" data-cacheurl=\"\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-retry=\"\">从日常送货的&ldquo;最后一公里&rdquo;，到支持火箭发射的&ldquo;3500公里&rdquo;，京东物流用稳定、智能的供应链，赢得了广大航天人的认可。此次和蓝箭航天的合作，不只是跨界创新，更是供应链科技助力国家航天事业发展的成功实践。</span></p>\n<section></section>\n<section><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1778818576894.png\" alt=\"图片\" width=\"1080\" height=\"608\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/obuknibTL19bKfd2w1much1UczSV50HbSadnl7XrrTSOb5S2RYeRU2uxECkWPr86pc72J4FqPIZ0AlHJ12hLM3KYNvB2j5XIia6IJvAxHlO88/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg#imgIndex=4\" data-ratio=\"0.562962962962963\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" data-imgfileid=\"503590714\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-original-style=\"null\" data-index=\"7\" data-report-img-idx=\"4\" data-fail=\"0\" /></section>\n<p class=\"sl-paragraph\">&nbsp;</p>", "contentAbstract": "", "contentCode": "content03340", "contentTitle": "“京东快递”飞向太空！", "contentType": 2, "createTime": 1778818607000, "id": 7658, "isDelete": 0, "link": "", "linkType": 0, "projectName": "京东物流官网", "srcUrl": "/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1778818598710.png", "updateTime": 1779069045000}}